    "pages": [
      {
        "source_page_id": "jichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p001",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "問題　円と2本の直線を順に整理する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "1）　円と直線を連立する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "何を求めるか",
            "text": "円と直線の2交点を求め、点Aから各交点までの長さを計算します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "直線 \\(\\ell_1:x+y=9\\) から \\(y=9-x\\) として、円の式へ代入します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(x-7)^2+(9-x-7)^2=17",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x^2-9x+18=(x-3)(x-6)=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "Q(3,6),\\qquad R(6,3)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "点 \\(A(1,8)\\) からのベクトルを作ると、長さは成分の2乗和の平方根で求まります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{AQ}=(2,-2),\\qquad \\overrightarrow{AR}=(5,-5)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "AQ=2\\sqrt2,\\qquad AR=5\\sqrt2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-overview-diagram",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "2）　中心から直線までの距離を見る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "まず \\(\\ell_2\\) を \\(y=m(x-1)+8\\) と直します。点 \\(A(1,8)\\) を通り、傾きが \\(m\\) の直線です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "jichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "最初にすること",
            "text": "円と直線が異なる2点で交わる条件は、中心から直線までの距離が半径より小さいことです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{|m(7-1)-(7-8)|}{\\sqrt{m^2+(-1)^2}}<\\sqrt{17}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "|6m+1|<\\sqrt{17(m^2+1)}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "両辺が正なので2乗してよく、2次不等式へ直します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "19m^2+12m-16<0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{-6-2\\sqrt{85}}{19}<m<\\frac{-6+2\\sqrt{85}}{19}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "最後に問題の条件 \\(m>-1\\) と共通部分を取ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "-1<m<\\frac{-6+2\\sqrt{85}}{19}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "3）　平行線の角と円周角をつなぐ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-proof-diagram",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "考え方",
            "text": "平行線から得る同位角と、円に内接する四角形の対角の和が \\(\\pi\\) であることを同時に使います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(\\angle AQP=\\alpha_1\\)、\\(\\angle ARS=\\alpha_2\\)、\\(\\angle APQ=\\beta_1\\)、\\(\\angle ASR=\\beta_2\\) と置きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2,\\qquad \\beta_1=\\beta_2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\beta_2+(\\pi-\\alpha_1)=\\pi,\\qquad \\alpha_2+(\\pi-\\beta_1)=\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\alpha_1=\\beta_2,\\qquad \\beta_1=\\alpha_2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "jichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "ここまでの等式をまとめると、4つの角はすべて等しくなります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2=\\beta_1=\\beta_2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "三角形の底角が等しいので、それぞれ二等辺三角形です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "AP=AQ,\\qquad AR=AS",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "次に \\(\\triangle ABP\\) と \\(\\triangle ABQ\\) を比べます。\\(AB\\) は共通、\\(AP=AQ\\)、\\(BP=BQ\\) は円の半径なので、3辺がそれぞれ等しい合同です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\triangle ABP\\equiv\\triangle ABQ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\angle BAP=\\angle BAQ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "したがって直線 \\(AB\\) は \\(\\angle SAR\\) の二等分線です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "4）　二等辺三角形の中点と垂線を使う",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-midpoint-diagram",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "直線 \\(AB\\) と弦 \\(PQ\\) の交点を \\(M\\) とします。\\(AP=AQ\\) で、\\(AM\\) は頂角の二等分線なので、二等辺三角形の性質から中線と垂線にもなります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "M\\text{ は }PQ\\text{ の中点},\\qquad AM\\perp PQ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\operatorname{slope}(AB)=\\frac{7-8}{7-1}=-\\frac16",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(PQ\\perp AB\\) なので \\(PQ\\) の傾きは6です。点 \\(Q(3,6)\\) を通るため、直線の式が決まります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PQ:\\ y=6(x-3)+6\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad 6x-y-12=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "AM=\\frac{|6\\cdot1-8-12|}{\\sqrt{6^2+1^2}}=\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{37}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "jichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "直角三角形 \\(AQM\\) で、1）で求めた \\(AQ=2\\sqrt2\\) と \\(AM\\) を使います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "QM=\\sqrt{AQ^2-AM^2}=\\sqrt{(2\\sqrt2)^2-\\left(\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{37}}\\right)^2}=\\frac{10}{\\sqrt{37}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PQ=2QM=\\frac{20}{\\sqrt{37}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "傾き6の方向ベクトルは \\((1,6)\\) です。長さを合わせて \\(\\overrightarrow{QP}\\) を作ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{QP}=\\frac{20}{37}(1,6)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{AP}=\\overrightarrow{AQ}+\\overrightarrow{QP}=(2,-2)+\\frac{20}{37}(1,6)=\\frac{2}{37}(47,23)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "m=\\frac{23}{47}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "5）　相似な2三角形の面積差を取る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(PQ\\parallel SR\\) なので \\(\\triangle AQP\\sim\\triangle ARS\\) です。相似比は \\(AQ:AR=2:5\\) だから、面積比はその2乗になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{[\\triangle ARS]}{[\\triangle AQP]}=\\left(\\frac{AR}{AQ}\\right)^2=\\frac{25}{4}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "[\\triangle AQP]=\\frac12\\cdot PQ\\cdot AM=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{20}{\\sqrt{37}}\\cdot\\frac{14}{\\sqrt{37}}=\\frac{140}{37}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "四角形 \\(PQRS\\) は大きい三角形 \\(ARS\\) から小さい三角形 \\(AQP\\) を引いた部分です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "[PQRS]=\\left(\\frac{25}{4}-1\\right)\\frac{140}{37}=\\frac{735}{37}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "jichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "別解 4）",
            "text": "原本は角と三角関数を使う別解も示しています。主解法を確認した後の別ルートとして読みます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-alternative-diagram",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(\\angle BAS=\\angle BAR=\\theta\\) とし、直線 \\(AR=\\ell_1\\) の傾きを \\(\\tan\\theta_1\\)、直線 \\(AB\\) の傾きを \\(\\tan\\theta_2\\) とします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\tan\\theta_1=-1,\\qquad \\tan\\theta_2=-\\frac16",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\tan\\theta=\\tan(\\theta_2-\\theta_1)=\\frac{\\tan\\theta_2-\\tan\\theta_1}{1+\\tan\\theta_2\\tan\\theta_1}=\\frac57",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "m=\\tan(\\theta_2+\\theta)=\\frac{\\tan\\theta_2+\\tan\\theta}{1-\\tan\\theta_2\\tan\\theta}=\\frac{23}{47}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "別解 5）",
            "text": "同じ角 \\(\\theta\\) を使えば、三角形ARSの面積から相似な三角形AQPの面積を引けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "[\\triangle ARS]=\\frac12(5\\sqrt2)^2\\sin2\\theta=25\\sin2\\theta",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{[\\triangle AQP]}{[\\triangle ARS]}=\\left(\\frac{AQ}{AR}\\right)^2=\\frac4{25}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "[PQRS]=21\\sin2\\theta=42\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "jichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(\\tan\\theta=5/7\\) なので、底辺7、高さ5の直角三角形で \\(\\sin\\theta\\) と \\(\\cos\\theta\\) を表します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-trig-triangle",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta=\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{7^2+5^2}}\\cdot\\frac{7}{\\sqrt{7^2+5^2}}=\\frac{35}{74}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "[PQRS]=42\\cdot\\frac{35}{74}=\\frac{735}{37}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "実戦での進め方",
            "text": "原本の解説は、1）2）は比較的取り組みやすく、3）の証明は発想負荷が高いと評価しています。3）を証明できなくても、そこで示す結論を使って4）5）へ進む方針を勧めています。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "4）5）には、主解法のベクトル・距離・相似を使う方法と、別解の角・三角関数を使う方法があります。まず自分が再現しやすい主解法を一つ固め、余裕があれば別解で結果を確かめます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      }
